---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
const works = ["校园 / Campus","人像 / Portrait","城市 / City","纪实 / Documentary"];
---
<BaseLayout title="作品 · SCU LENS" active="/gallery">
  <div class="page-shell">
    <section class="page-hero">
      <div class="eyebrow">Selected Works</div>
      <h1 class="display">作品</h1>
      <p>这里将作为摄协作品的长期展陈空间。首版先保留稳定的信息架构，之后可以直接按专题、作者、年份扩展。</p>
    </section>
    <section class="section">
      <div class="gallery-grid">
        {works.map((work) => <article class="photo-placeholder"><span>{work}</span></article>)}
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
